<title>SPAIN: Spain April M4 up provisional annualised 0.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain April M4 up provisional annualised 0.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the</p>
<p>following figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    APR 97     MAR 96     FEB 95</p>
<p> M4 pct rise			0.3	  2.3	 -0.9</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise     9.5	  8.2	 18.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis.</p>
<p>Revised figures for previous months will follow later.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
